{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_cave","model_identifier":"lair_cave","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_cave\n\nLair: cave (C6, bats, rats, spiders).\n\nA jagged cave mouth about 4 m wide (110 u at the base, 92 u high) set into the foot of a stepped grey rock cliff (up to 166 u high, grass and moss on the ledges), black inside, with rock teeth overhanging its edges, claw scratch marks gouged into the rock on both sides, droppings at the threshold, and bones, skulls and boulders scattered in front. Footprint 16 x 10 terrain columns (256 x 160 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -128.0..130.0, y 0.0..166.0, z -94.0..64.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- cliff: 260 x 166 x 84 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = 22, from y = 0 (impassable)\n- mouth: 110 x 92 opening on the cliff face at z = -20; units spawn from fx_spawn\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 0, -14)\n- `fx_bats` on `root` at (0, 70, -10)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: just inside the mouth; `fx_bats`: high in the mouth (bat swarms).\n- Destroyed version: `lair_cave_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n"},"description":"# lair_cave\n\nLair: cave (C6, bats, rats, spiders).\n\nA jagged cave mouth about 4 m wide (110 u at the base, 92 u high) set into the foot of a stepped grey rock cliff (up to 166 u high, grass and moss on the ledges), black inside, with rock teeth overhanging its edges, claw scratch marks gouged into the rock on both sides, droppings at the threshold, and bones, skulls and boulders scattered in front. Footprint 16 x 10 terrain columns (256 x 160 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -128.0..130.0, y 0.0..166.0, z -94.0..64.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- cliff: 260 x 166 x 84 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = 22, from y = 0 (impassable)\n- mouth: 110 x 92 opening on the cliff face at z = -20; units spawn from fx_spawn\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 0, -14)\n- `fx_bats` on `root` at (0, 70, -10)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: just inside the mouth; `fx_bats`: high in the mouth (bat swarms).\n- Destroyed version: `lair_cave_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n","resolution":{"width":512,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"cliff_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-110.0,0.0,-20.0],"to":[110.0,112.0,60.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[60,166,280.0,278.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,316,80.0,428.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[280,166,500.0,278.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[80,316,160.0,428.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,428,220.0,508.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"47ca7d21-7d82-5303-9b32-7fd284171ec5"},{"name":"cliff_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-120.0,0.0,-6.0],"to":[-60.0,150.0,64.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[420,0,480.0,150.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[280,0,350.0,150.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,166,60.0,316.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[350,0,420.0,150.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[400,428,460.0,498.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"textur